      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present new to the market for sale no.207 Clogher Road. This beautiful 2 bed property is sure to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser looking for somewhere to call home.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Crumlin, number 207 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, cafes, parks, sports facilities, primary and secondary schools as well as the soon to be Crumlin Shopping Centre. It is also in close proximity to areas such as Rialto and Drimnagh which adds even more options in terms of amenities.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property you are immediately met with a small but welcoming entrance hallway. Off this you are led into a magnificent open plan ground floor, a real staple of modern living which boasts both convenience and comfort. Whether you want to relax and unwind after a long day or entertain family and friends, this space gives you the opportunity to do both with ease.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a good sized and private back garden with a decking area just outside the door as well as at the rear of the garden. This space needs little to no work to be made into a tranquil garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two bedrooms, a single bedroom to the rear and a second large double room to the front aspect. A fully tiled and modern family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThis area benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running through the area. The M50 motorway is also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\n- Turn key condition\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Open plan\r\n- Large back garden"
      },
      {
